In article <1991Feb28.135647.15319@uqvax.cc.uq.oz.au> cowood@uqvax.cc.uq.oz.au writes:
>Proposal: Medusa should carry a wand of polymorph.
>
> - Because there's only one Medusa, poly-abuses would be kept down.

Actually, the only way this would cut down on poly-abuses would be if 
a)	You couldn't find wands of polymorphing lying around the dungeon randomly
	and
b)	You couldn't create wands of polymorph by using a wand of polymorph.

Having a monster automatically have a wand of polymorph would just increase
the amount of abuse;  not only would you have the wands you find like you
do now, you'd automatically get one when you killed Medusa.

Let's face it, there're lots of things you can abuse in Nethack.  I found
a bunch of magic markers in my current game, and have written at least 5 
scrolls of genocide just to bring in enough wraiths that I made it up
to 30th level before I even got to the castle.  (Used a ring of conflict
there;  once you're 30th level, who cares about experience? :)

Certainly holy water can be abused, at least somewhat, just by blessing
everything in sight.  

I guess the key thing you need to survive in nethack is *patience*.  I'd
guess well over 90% of characters die through stupidity or trying to 
advance too fast, at least the ones who live long enough that starvatation
isn't a problem.  The gods know most of *my* characters have died from
doing something stupid... (every once in a while something unavoidable
happens, but most of the time it's that one fatal mistake... )

Ah, well, enough rambling for one posting...
